{
  "id": "model_trellis2",
  "description": "Image to textured low-poly mesh with TRELLIS.2 (int8). The TRELLIS.2 path of ComfyUI's official template 3d_pixal3d_trellis2_image_to_model.json (Pixal3D and MoGe left out; node ids kept), with the mesh stage changed for mobile, as probed on the coin: TRELLIS.2's raw mesh is ~19.6M triangles with 104k open and 247k non-manifold edges. The template's remesh (UDF, 768) keeps ~18.6M and an inner shell, and one decimation step to a 300-tri budget then drops the flat faces (the coin came out a ring). So: remesh coarse (UDF 128, inner shell and enclosed parts dropped: ~113k closed, manifold tris), decimate with QEM placement to the class budget, unwrap, bake base colour from the voxels and a normal map from the 113k mesh onto the low-poly UVs at the class texture size. Upsample at 1024 (the minimum) instead of 1536 for 8 GB.",
